.\" Code generated from the ModelNet Commander command tree.
.TH MODELNET 1 "" "@modelnet/cli 0.0.38" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
modelnet \- manage and connect to ModelNet services
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B modelnet
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ModelNet CLI provides authentication, device gateway connectivity, content generation, resource search, and management commands for agents, files, models, providers, skills, knowledge bases, threads, topics, and related resources.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.modelnet/credentials.json
Encrypted access and refresh tokens.
.TP
.I ~/.modelnet/settings.json
CLI settings such as server and gateway URLs.
.TP
.I ~/.modelnet/daemon.pid
Background daemon PID file.
.TP
.I ~/.modelnet/daemon.status
Background daemon status metadata.
.TP
.I ~/.modelnet/daemon.log
Background daemon log output.
.PP
The base directory can be overridden with the
.B MODELNET_CLI_HOME
environment variable.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B modelnet login
Start interactive login in the browser.
.TP
.B modelnet connect --daemon
Start the device gateway connection in the background.
.TP
.B modelnet --help
Show all available commands.
.SH SEE ALSO
.B modelnet man
